# Gideon's emblem stops its controller losing to Glorious End while that player controls a Gideon planeswalker (CR 104.3, 114.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Gideon of the Trials
Glorious End
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Gideon of the Trials.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon of the Trials.Activate(Ability: #3)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gideon of the Trials.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Glorious End.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Emblems = Gideon of the Trials emblem
Bot2.CantWin = true
Bot1.CantWin = (absent)
